mgix.net/4b17f317/uploads/origins/43311202-6a89-4d1f-9501-eb0defade143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=284a0e038496c28d08b5794dbc78cffc, https://si.imgix.net/4b17f317/uploads/origins/43311202-6a89-4d1f-9501-eb0defade143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7e7999400fb753e33f4c3fdbd52ef96c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4b17f317/uploads/origins/43311202-6a89-4d1f-9501-eb0defade143?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5188b6e97466bc785688c71ca0b78680 3x"}, "body": "Hello, 4en.\nI saw your illustration on my timeline and would love for you to draw a single-panel illustration of the characters linked in the reference URL, so I’m sending you this request.\nThese are TRPG characters, but there are no spoilers in the link.\n\n＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿\n\n\n■Detailed Character Profiles\n① Kuku\nhttps://www.tumblr.com/quiqui-island/777971494740508672/%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E9%B4%BF-%E3%81%8F%E3%81%8F\n\n② Shō Inu-Washi\nhttps://www.tumblr.com/quiqui-island/777971239965900800/%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E7%8B%97%E9%B7%B2-%E7%BF%94\n\n▌Relationship\nThe same being from different timelines. They met only once when they were caught up in a major incident and their own existence became uncertain, and that encounter gave them courage regarding each other’s existence. As they live in separate worlds, whenever they face a crisis, they pray to each other to share their courage. They are like heroes.\n\n▌Elements\nReunion, moonlight, grasslands, flowers, holding hands\n＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿\n\nAny composition or clothing is fine. Please draw it in whatever style is easiest for you, 4en.\n\nI would like to use the illustration as an icon, header, and, if possible, as a design concept for personal merchandise.\nWhen using it in public spaces such as social media, I will credit your name and ID.\n\nI would greatly appreciate your consideration.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bd5ddff7/uploads/origins/311c486c-c82c-420d-94ec-5b998f4b514f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=685d28f246fd6337693a7c26d92f99fc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bd5ddff7/uploads/origins/311c486c-c82c-420d-94ec-5b998f4b514f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=685d28f246fd6337693a7c26d92f99fc, https://si.imgix.net/bd5ddff7/uploads/origins/311c486c-c82c-420d-94ec-5b998f4b514f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=647c050f1ef6d0254dea8b60182778ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bd5ddff7/uploads/origins/311c486c-c82c-420d-94ec-5b998f4b514f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2bf184c72bb6d7c0bc5dd74cdc89e2fb 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2582289, "client_id": 2780524, "nc": 1}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2582289, "client_id": 3723823, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/62ff07ca/uploads/origins/8b0d4540-8d7c-4228-950b-82f5cd620124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfe549c830062d45c1180796f41d66df", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/62ff07ca/uploads/origins/8b0d4540-8d7c-4228-950b-82f5cd620124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfe549c83006