cons or headers for social networking sites with IDs.\nIf there are any shortcomings in the amount, description, or materials, please do not hesitate to resend them to us. You may cancel your request if it seems too difficult. We hope you will consider our offer when you have time.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1oRMKg98iSgt5KjIMDDPUTh5CzRu13sXT", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2582289, "client_id": 580997, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cbf74a61/uploads/origins/b56622e6-8b1a-4592-8673-f2713267acf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f55452f8581ac5a746586a742edfc53b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cbf74a61/uploads/origins/b56622e6-8b1a-4592-8673-f2713267acf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f55452f8581ac5a746586a742edfc53b, https://si.imgix.net/cbf74a61/uploads/origins/b56622e6-8b1a-4592-8673-f2713267acf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a54c166bc7c4fd790fc2813ec04b3000 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cbf74a61/uploads/origins/b56622e6-8b1a-4592-8673-f2713267acf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9061dbd94eae07f16ba871a26ee499ea 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cbf74a61/uploads/origins/b56622e6-8b1a-4592-8673-f2713267acf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=15d4e708302ebe38c301ebf418b4ee95", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cbf74a61/uploads/origins/b56622e6-8b1a-4592-8673-f2713267acf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=15d4e708302ebe38c301ebf418b4ee95, https://si.imgix.net/cbf74a61/uploads/origins/b56622e6-8b1a-4592-8673-f2713267acf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1fb0ed7c38cc0a72f2027b5037bca8a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cbf74a61/uploads/origins/b56622e6-8b1a-4592-8673-f2713267acf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=92d5f6d8b92108d9adb50632e3eddf1a 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI visited X and was attracted by the colorful yet calm and serene atmosphere of your illustrations.\n\nMy request is for an original character created by myself within the rules of the TRPG system.\nI will provide you with the materials for several characters, so please check them and draw one character that you feel comfortable drawing. We like all of the characters very much, so we would be happy to have you draw any of them.\nWe will leave the composition, situation, etc. completely up to you. If anything, I would be more pleased if the illustration is a bit lonely or shady. Feel free to omit, detach, or alter parts of the illustration as you wish.\n\nUsage\nBasically, for personal viewing.\nI may use it as a reference image when requesting another person's work or as a header icon for a social networking service (in that case, I will write the ID).\n\nThe attached URL contains a summary of character designs and detailed information.\nThe amount of information is quite large, but we thought it would be better to have it than not have it at all. We do not mind if there are any omissions, so we would appreciate it if you could check it as much as you feel comfortable with.\n\nIf there are any omissions, please feel free to ask us to resend it to you at any time.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15Ehb1_pWMTWGf90jvWOVLDsxuqY7cepC?usp=drive_link", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2582289, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/86702ff4/uploads/origins/bd3d6896-2805-4164-84c4-87f6d8383812?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f6024967bf4cc490b26b4d81f8de324", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/86702ff4/uploads/origins/bd3d6896-2805-4164-84c4-87f6d8383812?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f6024967bf4cc490b26b4d81f8de324, https://si.imgix.net/86702ff4/uploads/origins/bd3d6896-2805-4164-84c4-87f6d8383812?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17de472b52e78942c2e679008f4bb5d0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/86702ff4/uploads/origins/bd3d6896-2805-4164-84c4-87f6d8383812?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ff308260c08a48099a7ae874e658d15 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/86702ff4/uploads/origins/bd3d6896-2805-4164-84c4-87f6d8383812?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ee4e5541db1f5a676e65d4c185f65d3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/86702ff4/uploads/origins/bd3d6896-2805-4164-84c4-87f6d8383812?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ee4e5541db1f5a676e65d4c185f65d3, https://si.imgix.net/86702ff4/uploads/origins/bd3d6896-2805-4164-84c4-87f6d8383812?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1eabeed596832b7ba018ed0054890a9f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/86702ff4/uploads/origins/bd3d6896-2805-4164-84c4-87f6d8383812?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0fdb04d9698cf0cdadb3d80005fc7c7c 3x"}, "body": "Hi, I fell in love with your beautiful illustration on the X search and I would like to request you to draw our OC as well......!\n\nCharacter's data\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-8NFpqMX1KMplroOfT6T8YwocsLgqHAo\n\nOutline of the character\nGender: male\nPersonality: He has few emotional ups and downs, and wears a melancholy atmosphere. Although he has few ups and downs, his facial expressions change easily, so it is rather easy to understand his moods. He is a natural and outgoing person, and has an eye for ice cream.\nOthers: I am a sister male who was raised as a girl.\nNow he lives alone in an abandoned church.\n\nAbout the content of the illustration\nThe composition and situation can be left up to you.\nYou are free to change the clothes, hair style, etc. Simplification is also fine.\nThere is no NG at all, so please draw as you like!\n\nAbout the use\nPersonal viewing\nUse as an icon on SNS such as X, etc.\nWe do not make goods or use them for commercial purposes.\n\nWe are very sorry if we are rude in price, content, etc. Please feel free to reject our proposal if it is too severe.\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-8NFpqMX1KMplroOfT6T8YwocsLgqHAo", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1dfb10d/uploads/origins/9fca739a-8a7f-4b0b-8f5f-9b5b098da474?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b335f4e698a012af60f42f6c8801eb4c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1dfb10d/uploads/origins/9fca739a-8a7f-4b0b-8f5f-9b5b098da474?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b335f4e698a012af60f42f6c8801eb4c, https://si.imgix.net/f1dfb10d/uploads/origins/9fca739a-8a7f-4b0b-8f5f-9b5b098da474?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign