ads/origins/260b2224-daab-42f2-a938-32ab4e262fa5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a287011423e3b5717dc6152e7f6e3e91 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1887531c/uploads/origins/260b2224-daab-42f2-a938-32ab4e262fa5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8018b4d400f3b6cf6c1577f2018ca12c 3x"}, "body": "good morning/evening! biggest fan of your art. i'd like to request a drawing of my male daughter (crossdresser, male) in any cool pose or cute pose.\n\nhe is a chuunibyou. his name is nanami. https://kaiba-corp.neocities.org/characters/nanamfinal.png\n\nhttps://kaiba-corp.neocities.org/characters/nanamfinal.png", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2582289, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9bd8f99/uploads/origins/ef1e55cc-04a6-4b57-a630-65d2fe1fb38e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b66f1999fa2a4006dc115a2d094f9f4b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d9bd8f99/uploads/origins/ef1e55cc-04a6-4b57-a630-65d2fe1fb38e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b66f1999fa2a4006dc115a2d094f9f4b, https://si.imgix.net/d9bd8f99/uploads/origins/ef1e55cc-04a6-4b57-a630-65d2fe1fb38e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8d4821d3f87228753541900b8e400a8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d9bd8f99/uploads/origins/ef1e55cc-04a6-4b57-a630-65d2fe1fb38e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bf3c494d4f6cb64b141083b3de3a5e4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9bd8f99/uploads/origins/ef1e55cc-04a6-4b57-a630-65d2fe1fb38e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dc9435305bc39a2b9440e3fb697218df", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d9bd8f99/uploads/origins/ef1e55cc-04a6-4b57-a630-65d2fe1fb38e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dc9435305bc39a2b9440e3fb697218df, https://si.imgix.net/d9bd8f99/uploads/origins/ef1e55cc-04a6-4b57-a630-65d2fe1fb38e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=286df337e61057c3a61adfb7d99b8572 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d9bd8f99/uploads/origins/ef1e55cc-04a6-4b57-a630-65d2fe1fb38e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=391a9c0c26bc19f0b96cb40d6009da27 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI am supporting 4en's account from the shadows.\nI love 4en's illustrations with colors that seem to be clothed in temperature! I would love to commission you to do an illustration.\n\nI would love to commission you to do an illustration for me.\nI would like to ask you to create two male characters out of my and my friend's creations. (My friend has given me permission to use his characters in my work.)\n\nMale 1\nHe is aloof and has a mature face. He is a person who can afford to be in a protective role for Male 2.\n\nMale 2\nHe is emotional and has a young face. He sometimes has a hard time expressing himself frankly to Male 1, but he trusts him.\n\n(More details are in the handout.)\n\nTheir job is to be a hit man and to support the hit man. (Male 1 is the assassin).\nThere is no romantic relationship, but they trust each other more than anyone else in their bromance relationship.\n\nRequests.\nI would like to have a composition of the two men standing shoulder to shoulder and smiling modestly, but I can leave it up to you.\nI also love the color of the sky that 4en draws, so I would be happy if the background is sky blue.\n\nUsage.\nPersonal viewing\nIcon use (X only)\nSharing your work among friends\n    (Showing only)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JltxL8PvJAXqPQquxGJyI5Ct7ykH9-ge", "nc": 24, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2582289, "client_id": 2314961, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0c0c27c7/uploads/origins/9651379d-2b99-4018-a61f-2ba6ccb3d9a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18b3bbcaaa8445acc4228774bfdb2596", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0c0c27c7/uploads/origins/9651379d-2b99-4018-a61f-2ba6ccb3d9a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18b3bbcaaa8445acc4228774bfdb2596, https://si.imgix.net/0c0c27c7/uploads/origins/9651379d-2b99-4018-a61f-2ba6ccb3d9a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67a4461a26c86600b96a0be7faaee922 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0c0c27c7/uploads/origins/9651379d-2b99-4018-a61f-2ba6ccb3d9a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=602e09d27e4b633607820b3acc5ad9b7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0c0c27c7/uploads/origins/9651379d-2b99-4018-a61f-2ba6ccb3d9a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=879cee87a6af3d8ec460473396efa6ed", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0c0c27c7/uploads/origins/9651379d-2b99-4018-a61f-2ba6ccb3d9a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=879cee87a6af3d8ec460473396efa6ed, https://si.imgix.net/0c0c27c7/uploads/origins/9651379d-2b99-4018-a61f-2ba6ccb3d9a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7671099be4f812d8326c8ad841136854 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0c0c27c7/uploads/origins/9651379d-2b99-4018-a61f-2ba6ccb3d9a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9f79f44c0bc51540eab260aa722d505d 3x"}, "body": "Hello, 4en! Thank you very much for your help.\nI always enjoy looking at your wonderful illustrations. I would like to send you a request to draw my OC as well, if you don't mind.\n\n▼Character\nI would like to request an illustration of two male employees of one of my creative companies, \"Siena\" and \"Yuna\", as a duo.\nThe situation, composition, etc. are all up to you!\n\nIntended use\nFor personal viewing\nCreation of personalized goods\n\n▼Documents, etc.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cDhWCcwaZMj4NmMfLoRCS-90vx-wI4Oh\n\nThank you for taking the time to read through this information. Thank you for your cooperation!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2582289, "client_id": 2543449, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a75b1f8a/uploads/origins/6aa8e82e-bcbe-46cd-a68c-a0708434de0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c01c8783531a26320d7fce7644ef4b8f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a75b1f8a/uploads/origins/6aa8e82e-bcbe-46cd-a68c-a0708434de0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c01c8783531a26320d7fce7644ef4b8f, https://si.imgix.net/a75b1f8a/uploads/origins/6aa8e82e-bcbe-46cd-a68c-a0708434de0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=482be874b30e797b8d206f205d94fd8e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a75b1f8a/uploads/origins/6aa8e82e-bcbe-46cd-a68c-a0708434de0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d2ab567872a81a61044e32ccec25605 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a75b1f8a/uploads/origins/6aa8e82e-bcbe-46cd-a68c-a0708434de0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=63220d303fb9b3bba3aee44c73f9376c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a75b1f8a/uploads/origins/6aa8e82e-bcbe-46cd-a68c-a0708434de0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=63220d303fb9b3bba3aee44c73f9376c, https://si.imgix.net/a75b1f8a/uploads/origins/6aa8e82e-bcbe-46cd-a68c-a0708434de0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=62eeee2d8fe17d186e0e42f5d6dcdea8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a75b1f8a/uploads/origins/6aa8e82e-bcbe-46cd-a68c-a0708434de0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=599fbb6b80dd2163f06fb40709f39d47 3x"}, "body": "Thank you very much for all your support.\nPlease allow me to commission the Meyer siblings, which I have been wanting 4en to draw for a long time.\n\nI love 4en's high-firepower one-picture drawings, which take me deeper and deeper the more I look at them, so I welcome any kind of composition, whether it is disturbing or happy.\n\nI love your work, and I am happy to accept any composition, no matter how disturbing or happy it may be.\nThank you very much in advance.\n\n\nHere is a brief information\nEli\nKiki's older brother, former military doctor.\nThe scar on his cheek was injured as a child by a branch sticking out when he slid down a steep slope to save his sister who had fallen.\nHe learned to play the violin as a child.\n\nSince the loss of his sister, he has taken a step back from himself and others.\nHe unconsciously suppresses his deepest emotions.\n(Her sister's last will and testament, \"Please don't hate anyone, don't hate anyone,\" has become a curse.)\n\nKiki.\nEli's younger sister, an apprentice nurse who used to help out at her family's hospital but decided to follow her family and brother into the war without telling them.\nInnocent, loves to talk.\nHas a complex about her freckles.\n\nEli, who saved his friend and foe alike in the war, was considered an act of treason and was ordered to be shot dead. Kiki, who defended him, was killed by a bullet. The medical tent was set on fire, and Eli escaped with his colleagues and survived.\nKiki's body was never found after the fire.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-NmqxeWUWwLds1EVzPUkXiAhoD5xcjdB", "nc": 56, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2582289, "client_id": 1351785, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/66d047af/uploads/origins/c6df1510-fe44-4bf1-aa4f-49bedbb7e62e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a774481466ac9c74c90d7190ec910b31", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66d047af/uploads/origins/c6df1510-fe44-4bf1-aa4f-49bedbb7e62e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a774481466ac9c74c90d7190ec910b31, https://si.imgix.net/66d047af/uploads/origins/c6df1510-fe44-4bf1-aa4f-49bedbb7e62e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c0e345fc42f953e7b390b8ae392fab7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66d047af/uploads/origins/c6df1510-fe44-4bf1-aa4f-49bedbb7e62e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83cfd4b65f0472e2aef491710941f051 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/66d047af/uploads/origins/c6df1510-fe44-4bf1-aa4f-49bedbb7e62e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a133a2169cfa6148dc9cda5153eec158", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66d047af/uploads/origins/c6df1510-fe44-4bf1-aa4f-49bedbb7e62e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a133a2169cfa6148dc9cda5153eec158, https://si.imgix.net/66d047af/uploads/origins/c6df1510