ve/folders/1QS3fMmR_IUF8pEcwYiatQE8JZj3GkaDC\n\nAva Solo (black hair)\nCool heavy smoker. Workaholic and likes to fight.\nHe is often pushed around. He has a mixture of hatred, love, and not wanting to lose to Tomas.\n\nTomas (green hair)\nHe is smiling and black-hearted. He likes to be in the dark.\nOften makes others around him feel like they are in the wrong. Although he doesn't admit it, he is obsessed with Abasolo and wants to monopolize him.\nI wrote in the material that he should be smiling with his eyes closed, but I'm fine with anything, whether it's a disturbing look or a smile! I'll leave the facial expressions up to you!\n\nSize, pose and composition are also up to you!\nWe are open to any kind of clothing as long as it is a black suit and a black necktie.\nYou can use any kind of expression you like, including bloodshed and violence.\n\nWe would also appreciate it if you would allow us to post the finished work on our website with the skeb URL, author ID, etc.\n\nIf there are any discrepancies in the price or the content of the request, we would appreciate it if you could resend the request to us.\nPlease consider this if you are willing to do so. Thank you very much.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QS3fMmR_IUF8pEcwYiatQE8JZj3GkaDC", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@t0_0xin/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2582289, "client_id": 2998824, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/75a1afdc/uploads/origins/8b864aa3-d612-4946-91c3-a75dc6a789be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3396faf088fec02859d03719129c3a54", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/75a1afdc/uploads/origins/8b864aa3-d612-4946-91c3-a75dc6a789be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3396faf088fec02859d03719129c3a54, https://si.imgix.net/75a1af